  "translation": [
    "Today is Sunday. Xiaoming and I went to a new restaurant for lunch. The restaurant is next to the university, and it is very big.",
    "When we went in, there were a lot of people inside. Xiaoming said, \"Look, there's a table on the left with nobody at it.\" I said, \"Great, let's sit there.\"",
